# One reviewer, because there is one maintainer. This file exists so that the branch ruleset can
# require a review at all, and so that the paths where a wrong change is most expensive are named
# rather than assumed.

*                       @take-works-tech

# The specification set is the contract. A change here changes what the product is.
/specs/                 @take-works-tech
/evidence/              @take-works-tech

# The gates, and the environment that runs them. A change here can make every other check stop
# meaning anything while continuing to report success.
/validate/              @take-works-tech
/.github/workflows/     @take-works-tech
/.claude/               @take-works-tech
/.codex/                @take-works-tech
